         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Take a quick look at what big data is, where it comes from, how it's used and why it's still relevant today.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Big Data: The basics of what it is and why it matters</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
